{"id":"777f84b63602303f","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-sacks-density.md","title":"c.e.度的稠密性","display":"thm-sacks-density — c.e.度的稠密性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-sacks-density","aliases":["43-thm-sacks-density"],"display":"thm-sacks-density — c.e.度的稠密性","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 5.12.1, print pp.49–54 / PDF pp.69–74","source_scope":"book-derived","previous_verification_status":"statement-checked","verification_status":"proved-in-note","local_proof_checked":true,"source_correspondence":"本断言由Theorem 5.12.1的两个不相容中间度推出，非原书逐字陈述；具体推导见Remark","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-sacks-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-sacks-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sacks-density — c.e.度的稠密性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 5.12.1, print pp.49–54 / PDF pp.69–74"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book-derived"},{"key":"previous_verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"本断言由Theorem 5.12.1的两个不相容中间度推出，非原书逐字陈述；具体推导见Remark"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>为c.e.集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_T\">\\(&lt;_T\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land A&lt;_TB\\Rightarrow\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{CE}(C)\\land A&lt;_TC\\land C&lt;_TB).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land A&lt;_TB\\Rightarrow\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{CE}(C)\\land A&lt;_TC\\land C&lt;_TB).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书Theorem 5.12.1给出更强的陈述：对c.e.集A&lt;_T B，存在c.e.集E_0,E_1，使D_i=E_i⊕A满足A≤_T D_i≤_T B，且D_0与D_1不相容。D_i仍是c.e.集。若D_0≡_T A，则D_0≤_T D_1；若D_0≡_T B，则D_1≤_T D_0；二者都与不相容性矛盾。因此取C=D_0得到A&lt;_T C&lt;_T B。这是由书中定理推出的稠密性推论，非原书逐字陈述。本地推导已核对；原书延迟许可优先树构造的完整证明未在本轮独立重证。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.12.1, print pp.49–54 / PDF pp.69–74。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CE}$ 与 $<_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]；$\\oplus$ 采用 [[43-df-turing-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CE}$ 与 $<_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]；$\\oplus$ 采用 [[43-df-turing-join]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CE}$ 与 $<_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]；$\\oplus$ 采用 [[43-df-turing-join]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"<_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)\\land A<_TB\\Rightarrow\\exists C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{CE}(C)\\land A<_TC\\land C<_TB).","display":true}],"bytes":1678,"backlinks":